# GSD planning corpus — local working state, deliberately NOT published.
# Held out of the public repo (and scrubbed from history 2026-07-31) because it
# carries exploratory notes, unsent outreach drafts, and session narrative that
# are working material rather than part of the shipped toolkit. The ADR trail
# that DOES belong to the toolkit lives in docs/adr/ and is tracked.
.planning/

# NOTE: the vendored source-of-truth assets are deliberately NOT ignored.
